{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLn5YQN3wLMZG2zaCf8E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made the change in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: I removed `needs: test` from the `deploy` job. Deploy no longer waits for the tests or depends on them. It starts as soon as you push to `main`.\n\nI kept the `test` job, so the tests still run, but now alongside the deploy. They no longer block anything, but they still tell you if something broke. If you'd rather not run them at all, I can delete the `test` job too.\n\nOne warning: `deploy` uses `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, so it's probably production with real payments. Without the gate, any commit that breaks the types or the reservation rules goes out anyway.\n\nTo speed things up while keeping the gate:\n- Cache dependencies with `cache: npm` in `setup-node`. This usually cuts down `npm ci`.\n- Split `typecheck` and `test` into parallel jobs, and have `deploy` wait for both.\n\nI haven't committed anything. Tell me if you want me to commit it as is, or try one of these options instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":19381,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90f40522-617a-4ec2-a752-ad1cf1776a35","uuid":"65635fbb-232c-4406-b913-888c07b3af53","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:06:51.429Z","request_id":"req_011ChLn5YGg7e8RpZgq23TVu"}
